50585400828", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75451783_503050588734161_2222964453019589899_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j_hUo2OHYH0Q7kNvwGHhaI2&_nc_oc=AdrFbtwnRItI99uht4KUyDVSSFUUTcZxQNMnv-KrprZNfYea89MVyD_FkFCufCUITsg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLzHbK2afmkvhekUKH5ctn8QfYlFikFbCXaZWoUKF32yA&oe=6AA3FA1F"}, {"file_name": "DungeonMaker_Classic.png", "id": "958112396267493", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974637_958112399600826_936053191076049290_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qCUaOUe59YMQ7kNvwFEafmJ&_nc_oc=Adq5YsZ-XVl0lqiiY3XlnsXQ7xxkEhq5hJCvxlc4erCKhbHEDtmwBGBbLiGsVGpdcNA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJBJCOyF91XZLa-ATZFpNXSGLU-fUkzMXRAdw5ituRRxQ&oe=6AA40485"}, {"file_name": "DungeonMaker_Tomb_3.png", "id": "1105680564431956", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75639801_1105680567765289_2699881368188163859_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ByZrnNG9_9oQ7kNvwGv_Ts8&_nc_oc=AdqGTv6VNe1JcgL4FujIY-9q_xbZZLWsPJM-eqpz9gGCMP7qJ5LR42y7mKr69x4DRpg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIQPeeX1tmFAMQWUAQoX9gHevIFAf5h6_vmHerMBqdy3Q&oe=6AA404FD"}, {"file_name": "com.FieldOfVision.DungeonMaker-20231018-180241.png", "id": "321920080425083", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982569_321920093758415_78624449223695311_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tL6q2n_Ju4EQ7kNvwGtw2gL&_nc_oc=Adp1MLaHHsrcTd-okRJ0VWwNTYVaLoVGRIUIvhIEdZ2Smhkl_5yKUBPwrSXulBYHWOs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJiPWsZV2BehItR2KRw1a2Yg_sEuItWcBsQrYAMarXgvw&oe=6AA3F674"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "LANDSCAPE_2560x1440.png", "id": "2360001101131996", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628050_2360001104465329_811509019894970622_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y_MjFpY2saoQ7kNvwHm0Ym-&_nc_oc=AdoQTI3oNuEj30fF5jivALuRqMjAm-iYWXkhffs09_buNIWfehYmp3ELH1n0gKs6Ofo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKQktlAbV_L3pb8gzH2DW_WhLqzz9JaqnivNLkG2sNu4w&oe=6AA40B26"}, "display_name": "Dungeon Maker", "keywords": ["dungeon", "sandbox", "adventure", "passthrough", "builder"], "long_description": "                                                                                                                                                                                                       \n{576958931641921}\n\nSires! __Dungeon Maker__ is a mixed reality sandbox game where you shape the adventure! Take control to build and customize every detail, or effortlessly generate endless dungeons (currently in __BETA__). \n\nWhether you create by hand or let the system do the work, prepare to explore traps, face enemies, and uncover quests in your own immersive dungeons.\n\nThis is a work-in-progress with regular updates and fixes. \n\nJoin my Discord to share feedback and ideas: www.DUNGEON-MAKER.com\n# -\n# GENERATE INFINITE DUNGEONS!  (BETA)\nThe dungeon foundation is created from your Meta rooms setup, then generate as many dungeons as you like!\n{1964062794072551}\n\n# SET DEADLY TRAPS AND QUESTS\nPlenty of traps and quest items to place around your home. Keys and doors, plots and treasures, deadly pits, swinging axes, skeletons!\n{884487527165107}\n\n# FIND THE TREASURE!\nCan you go deep enough into the dungeon to retrieve the treasure?\n{492385469938846}", "short_description": "Generate your own Dungeon in your home using Passthrough!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://privacy.fieldof.vision/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Field Of Vision", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://fieldof.vision/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_categ